<p>Thank you for signing up to gem.coop!</p>

<p>Here's your account activation link to verify your email address.</p>

<p><%= link_to "Activate my account", user_email_verification_url(@owner.email_verification.token) %></p>

<h3>How do I push gems?</h3>

<p>You'll need a new push key. Click here to <%= link_to "generate a new push key", new_user_push_key_url %>.</p>

<p>We're working on stronger modern authentication. More info soon.</p>

<h3>Feedback? Issues?</h3>

<p>Send them to us at <%= mail_to "support@gem.coop" %>, thank you!</p>
